# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CITATION_EXEMPT, fifth group — A DATED AUDIT THAT KEEPS THE NAMES OF ITS DAY.
#
# Added 2026-10-24 with the dialect hook's rename (guard-dialect.sh ->
